# Commit and push only when asked

Do **not** commit or push after code changes by default.

Only run `git commit` / `git push` when the user explicitly asks (e.g. 「提交」「推送」「commit」「push」).

When they do ask, skip secrets, binaries like `*.apk`, and temp scripts unless they specifically want those included.
